content:
This is a game full of cheaters. In a single night, I can run into cheating players 5–6 times in a row. Their common traits are:

1. Very low level, within level 50;
2. Win rates all above 80%;
3. At such a low level, they can easily bring out tens of millions of coins to join games;
4. They hit the ball without any thinking, shooting extremely quickly—it feels like they can shoot in just 0.1 seconds;
5. There is no logic at all in their shot positioning after potting.

With such obvious signs of cheating, the game company has imposed no restrictions whatsoever! I strongly suspect that whether people participate or not is itself part of the cheating industry chain. As a so-called long-term player, I am deeply disappointed! Extremely disappointed! If there is no improvement at all over time, I will leave this game! This game will eventually be abandoned by all loyal players and head toward destruction.
